Source: kfocus-settings
Section: x11
Maintainer: Kubuntu Focus Developers <support@kfocus.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), config-package-dev, intltool, plocate
Standards-Version: 4.7.3

Package: kfocus-settings
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: dpkg (>= 1.15.7.2~), kubuntu-settings-desktop, dkms (>=3.0)
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, kfocus-main (>> 22.0.54),
         kfocus-power-bin,
         kfocus-wallpapers
Recommends: plasma-desktop
Description: Kubuntu Focus Default Settings
 This package contains the default settings used by the Kubuntu Focus.
 It sets the default sddm theme and the theme and layout for the
 default session. It also pre-depends on dkms, and provides configs
 for it.
